    "created_at": "2016-01-14T17:49:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-14T17:49:45Z",
    "body": "I'm interested in aligning parsing here at least in theory.  This is not code that's well-owned in Gecko and hasn't been changed much in a long time; I don't feel like I have a good understanding of what's likely to be compatible here and what's not.  But if there's a simple enough and compatible spec I would certainly support it getting implemented.\n",
